# ==========================================================================
# GAME DATA -- NEVER COMMITTED.
#
# `assets/` holds a character imported out of the user's own copy of the game:
# meshes, a texture, animations. It lives in the project so the model can be
# opened and worked on in the editor, and it is EA's, so it stays local. The
# repository is code only -- the same rule the C project runs on, and the
# reason either of them can be shown to anyone.
# ==========================================================================
assets/
